<title>UK: London sugar freight.</title>
<headline>London sugar freight.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>New business - Fiji Sugar Marketing 16,200 Fiji to Portugal option Marseilles Aug 1/10.</p>
<p>Cargill 14,000 bagged Santos to Baltic Black Sea, Med, Red Sea, Indian Ocean options for mid July and 14,000 bagged Santos to Lagos prompt.</p>
<p>Fixtures - S. Africa Sugar Assn 18,000 bulk Durban to Tokyo prompt.</p>
<p>E.D and F Man 25,000 bulk Paranagua to Black Sea July 15/21 and 12,500/14,000 bagged from Santos, Paranagua or Imbituba to Lagos july 11/14.</p>
<p>Genoc 14,000 Maputo to London July 21/25 about $24.</p>
<p>London Newsroom, +44 171 542 7771</p>
</text>
